 body:"Giant moa grazed like deer, kiwi sniff out worms at night with nostrils at the tip of their beaks, and the kea, a mountain parrot, is famous for pulling rubber off cars. The kākāpō is a flightless, night-time parrot that smells sweet and can live 90 years.",
